summary:
  A station quieter than the target is turned up to it.

history:
  Turning up clips a stream that is already near full scale and raises the
  noise of a station that chose to be quiet. The quietest of the twenty
  measured stood at -21.1 LUFS and has to play as it is.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
      return Math.max(-MAX_CUT_DB, Math.min(0, TARGET_LUFS - lufs));

replace:
      return Math.max(-MAX_CUT_DB, TARGET_LUFS - lufs);

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_a_station_at_or_under_the_target_is_never_turned_up.
  Line-neutral.
